  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;efficiency is given, half of&nbsp;the energy of the falling water will be used by the bulbs. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3600</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p>"
  }
